      "type": "document",
      "name": "CLAUDE.md",
      "filePath": "CLAUDE.md",
      "summary": "面向 AI Agent（Claude Code / pi）的项目指南：包含源码布局说明、构建命令、关键架构决策（CGEventTap、TIS API、NSPanel 悬浮窗）以及若干开发陷阱提醒（首次启动授权、状态机一致性、overlay 跟随鼠标而非文本光标等）。",
      "tags": [
        "documentation",
        "agent-guide",
        "architecture",
        "gotchas"
      ],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "document:README.md",
      "type": "document",
      "name": "README.md",
      "filePath": "README.md",
      "summary": "项目主文档：说明功能特性（锁定 / 悬浮窗 / Shift 感知 / 菜单栏 / 设置 / 开机启动）、首次启动需要的辅助功能授权、目录结构、状态检测原理示意图以及打包 / 安装步骤。",
      "tags": [
        "documentation",
        "entry-point",
        "user-guide"
      ],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:build-app.sh",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "build-app.sh",
      "filePath": "build-app.sh",
      "summary": "将 LockChineseIME/ 下的 Swift 源码编译为 arm64 macOS 13+ 的 .app 包，并装配可分发的 .dmg 安装包（含 .icns 图标、/Applications 软链接、压缩为 UDZO）。",
      "tags": [
        "build-system",
        "packaging",
        "dmg",
        "shell-script"
      ],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "使用 swiftc 直接调用，无 SPM / Xcode；通过 sips + iconutil 从单张 PNG 生成多尺寸 .icns。"
    },
